Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些东西把萨姆塑造成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something turned him into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘的一串字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croatoan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔病毒？类似于恶魔病毒战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demonic virus? more like demonic germ warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们都感染怎么办？如果我们都步入疯狂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we all have it? what if we all go crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,追述到1835年 萨姆埃尔 科尔特造了一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in 1835, samuel colt made a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说这枪可以杀死一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say this gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是皮囊？- 你就是皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a vessel? - You're the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得得到我得同意 米伽勒也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need my consent. michael needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都取决于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my say-so to ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回答不\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白我是谁 - 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am. - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被选中的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是我的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切不会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你相信我 - 那你怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you don't trust me. - So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That i'm dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许分道扬镳才是最好的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's best we just go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计晚上好 准备放纵你的灵魂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. good evening, brother. is your soul rapture-ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生 愿上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. god bless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计晚上好 准备放纵你的灵魂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, folks. is your soul rapture-ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很愿意为你展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what i'd like to do is just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的最爱的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what god's love is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 愿上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, god bless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 朋友 有没有时间考虑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, friend, but have you taken time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的上帝计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}To think about god's plan for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很扯蛋 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too friggin' much, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在说科尔特 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about the colt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, as in the colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本没意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥恶魔要拿着这枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why would the demons keep a gun around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相厮杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, uh, kills demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? what? did…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't … I didn't get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's kind of funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在和上帝的邮差在通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking to a messenger of god on a cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好比看坠天使骑摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, you know, like watching a hells angel ride a mo-ped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好玩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't funny, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前面说的我都没听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voice says i'm almost out of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … i'm telling you, cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群混蛋现在想熔了那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mooks have melted down the gun by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到的可不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hear differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是实事而且你仍继续想完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's true and if you are still set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个白痴的猎杀恶魔任务的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the insane task of killing the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kansas city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,世纪旅馆 103房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Century hotel, room 113.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚开了16个小时的车才到这里好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just drove like 16 hours straight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是活生生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有点事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's stuff I got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭还有睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat, for example. in this case, sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我4个小时休息下 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need like four hours once in a while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以明天一早出现在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, you can pop in tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wait here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋卡西 我要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, cass, I need to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,4点04分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four past four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下内容很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你是它的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're his vessel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法进入你体内来和天使们大干一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's wearing you to the prom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你还认为你已经没有价值的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when you thought you were out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:03:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们又把你扯进来是不是 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pull you back in, huh, sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这反映\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your response?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望得到点什么 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点慌乱 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a little panic, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess i'm a little numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个惊天动地的消息有点麻木了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the earth-shattering revelations at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我想重操旧业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want back in, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够被这些狗娘养的摆布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sick of being a puppet to these sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想猎杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hunt him down, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 我们又重新回到复仇之路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so, we're back to revenge, then, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明啊 瞧咱上次的复仇结果多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause that worked out so well last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是 你就这样回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're just gonna walk back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又重新变成黄金搭档二人组\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna be the dynamic duo again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dean, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我会证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can. i'm gonna prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场末日决战中 我们一个是火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it turns out that you and me, we're the, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个就是油\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire and the oil of the armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了这个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, on that basis alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们也该各拣半个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just pick a hemisphere…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from each other for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不一定非得这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it does not have to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以抗争 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can fight it. - Yeah, you're right, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是在一起抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一起时 我们并没有更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not stronger when we're together, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是变弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不管我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because whatever we have between us …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爱 是亲情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, family, whatever it is …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总会利用这点来对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are always gonna use it against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分开更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're better off apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说不定能避开路西法和米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a better chance of dodging Lucifer and Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开这整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this whole damn thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们不在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just go our own ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}THE END.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一声不吭 有点让我毛骨悚然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the not-talking thing is kind of creepy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,2014年8月1日\N{\fnArial\fs30}"August 1st, 2014."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,收音有干扰 肯定没好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,croatoan病毒登陆澳洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Croatoan pandemic reaches Australia."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 回到未来这种狗血剧情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I smelled your stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你脱不了干系\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this "back to the future" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩林总统为轰炸休斯顿事件辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}"President Palin defends bombing of Houston."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,房地产业绝对是买方市场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly a buyer's market in real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看体育界有什么新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what's happening in sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了 没体育这回事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right … no more sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为国会撤销了集会权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congress revoked the right to group assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会也是徒负虚名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's left of congress, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说的话 不过剩个空架子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly a quorum, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被迫利用非常规资源 依靠一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid we had to tap some unorthodox resources of late …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human informants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还去找过一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been making inspirational visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较边缘的基督教团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the fringier Christian groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的照片给他们 让他们密切留意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been given your image, told to keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆外那个圣经狂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bible freak outside the motel …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向你打小报告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, what, dropped a dime on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进 信徒精兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward, Christian soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快送我回去 你个婊子养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now send me back, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会回去的 等时机到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll get back … all in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想让你在这浸个三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you to marinate a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,浸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marinate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天时间 看看能不能扭转你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days to see where this course of action takes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你的选择会带来相应的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that your choices have consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你继续对米迦勒说不的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what happens to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就会变成这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you continue to say "no" to Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a little look-see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.97,0:10:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我进来了喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody, bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤塔拉营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Camp Chitaqua."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么 我的爱车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhh. Baby, what did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得 该问这问题的是我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be asking that question, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 给我一个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, why don't you give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不该把你就地正法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I shouldn't gank you right here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那样你就是在伤害你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you'd only be hurting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是什么变形人或者魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no shapeshifter or demon or anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 趁你昏迷 我把驱魔术使了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I did the drill while you were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,银器 盐 圣水 都不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver, salt, holy water … nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有意思的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what was funny…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上藏着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的撬锁器 开箱器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hidden lockpick, box cutter, and switchblade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和弹簧刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,想解释一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you want to explain that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便解释一下 为什么你长得和我一摸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the, uh…resemblance, while you're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迦利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zachariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是2009年年末的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm you from the tail end of 2009.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迦利亚把我拽下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zach plucked me from my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔到5年以后的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And threw me five years into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪 我想和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? I want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.01,0:13:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈 你不知道 - 我的确不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you don't know. - No, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想回到我自己那一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just want to get back to my own friggin' year, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're me…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说几件只有我才知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me something only I would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗达· 赫尔利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhonda Hurley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时是…19岁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were, uh…19.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我们穿上她的内裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made us try on her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,内裤是粉色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很光滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And satiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还挺享受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kind of liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 撒迦利亚把你拽到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … Zach zapped you up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看事情变得多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see how bad it gets?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Croatoan病毒 这就是他们的杀手锏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croatoan virus, right? That's their endgame?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种病毒高效 无药可医\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's efficient, it's incurable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且非常恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's scary as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能把人变成怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns people into monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前开始袭击主要城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started hitting the major cities about two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后世界就一片狼藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}World really went in the crapper after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律生死之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavyweight showdown in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 萨姆没有撑下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I understand, Sam didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时没和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨姆在那之前 已经有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, me and Sam, we hadn't talked in…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,5年没联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没去找他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never tried to find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有其他人要操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got other people to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.46,0:15:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得出去办个差\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to run an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样把我一个人扔在这儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. you're just gonna leave me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有一营担惊受怕的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a camp full of twitchy trauma survivors out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑海中萦绕着世界末日的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an apocalypse hanging over their head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想让他们看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing they need to see is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这番诡异的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}a version of "th.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你必须待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, you stay locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. all right. fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不用把我铐起来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't have to cuff me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你连自己都不信任吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. you don't trust yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫不信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迪恩 你有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean. you got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 哦是的 我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. yes. uh…I-I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 目前我们有充分罐头储备\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, listen, we're pretty good on canned goods for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其他的都已经用尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're down to next to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐烂的食品…和卫生纸供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}On perishables and … and hygiene supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们可不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are not gonna be happy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许…共享吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, uh, share?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以色列集体农场那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like at a kibbutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你现在不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. aren't you supposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在出任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be out on a mission now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. and I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点！小姐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫芮莎 - 芮莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Risa. - Risa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨天整晚都在和简鬼混吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent the night in jane's cabin last night, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？有吗？我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what? i-i don't … did i?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为我们之间有过「一段情」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had a "connection."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'm sure that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 芮莎 - 死远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, risa. - Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我差点就莫名其妙地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, geez. i'm getting busted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了冤大头\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff I haven't done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰克 那个…卡西还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck, is…Cass still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他哪儿也不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think cass is going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这样来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, in this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是完形知觉中的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're each a fragment of total perception …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,分成不同的隔间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, one compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:18:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,由心灵之眼来洞察\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that dragonfly eye of group mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在理解这完形知觉的关键在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the key to this total, shared perception …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出乎意料的物理现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um… it's surprisingly physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和我们无畏的领袖之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I need to confer with our.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,得进行一些商讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearless leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不去沐浴放纵一下呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not go get washed up for the orgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都如此美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这算啥？嬉皮士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a hippie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你已经放弃给我归类的尝试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd gotten over trying to label me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡西 我们得谈谈 - 真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass, we got to talk. - Whoa. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…不是迪恩 不是现在的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…are not you … not "now" you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！我不是 完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! yeah. yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪一年来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,2009年\N{\fnArial\fs30}2009.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁送你来的？撒迦利亚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this to you? is it zachariah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:19:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真是相当的刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, it's friggin' fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此 你何不挥挥翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why don't you strap on your angel wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我送回去呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fly me back to my page on the calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想啊 挥挥翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could just, uh, strap on my wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很抱歉 不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i'm sorry … no dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝醉了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you stoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常来说…是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…generally, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡人的生活就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. hey! watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想骗你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他之间的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and him …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pretty messed-up situation we got going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在必要情况下 我会将一切告知你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you need to know something, you will know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在那之前 我们还是个忙个的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, we all have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话该我问你吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚冷血地射死一个大活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just shot a guy in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚才在暴露的隔离区内\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in an open quarantine zone …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离的时候被一群Crotes伏击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ambushed by some crotes on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crotes就是Croatoan病毒感染者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crotes … croatoans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其中一个猎人感染上了病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them infected yager.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过这么多年后 我掌握了经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause after a few years of this, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个半小时之后 我就能看出初步症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started seeing symptoms about a half an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后不久 他就会变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't gonna be long before he flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我一点也不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么好让你感到良心不安的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In troubling a good man with bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「良心不安」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"troubling a good man"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当着自己人的面杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just blew him away in front of your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不觉得这会是人心惶惶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that freaked them out a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可是2014年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 2014.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,射死一只Crote 是再正常不过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plugging some crote … it's called commonplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,相比之下 和你在一起唧唧歪歪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trading words with my friggin' clone …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才会叫他们惶恐不安呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might have freaked them out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 该你听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的时代 不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't your time. it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮不到你来发号施令 由我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't make the decisions. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我命令你乖乖呆着 你就得照办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when I say stay in, you stay in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 哥们 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, man. i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不想搞砸你…或者我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i-i'm not trying to mess you or…me …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周末真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been a really wacky weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 是什么任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the mission, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花了5年时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been moving it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me five years, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最终找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我要去干掉恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tonight, i'm gonna kill the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这就是科尔特枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it? that's the colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么能杀死路西法 只有这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything can kill Lucifer, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经找到路西法一些线索了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we got anything that can find lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.57,0:22:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 我们昨天在简的小木屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we were in, uh, Jane's cabin last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 我们和芮莎谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, apparently, we and…risa have a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们闭嘴好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必找路西法 我们知道他的方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to find Lucifer. we know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上周抓的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon that we caught last week …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是 他们的亲信之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was one of the…big guy's entourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 一个恶魔告诉你撒旦的动向\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a Demon tells you where satan's gonna be,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么相信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 他没有撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, trust me … he wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know this how?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我们无畏的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fearless leader, i'm afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,受过这方面的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is all too well schooled in the art of getting to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,严刑拷问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们又开始用这招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so, we're … we're torturing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很棒 很经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's … that's good. classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢以前的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I like "past you."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我了解这块儿地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know the block and I know the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.57,0:23:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 就在禁区中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good … it's right in the middle of a hot zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是僵尸 你说我计划太鲁莽了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crawling with crotes, yeah. you saying my plan is reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.21,0:24:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 我们要直接走上马路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying we, uh, walk in straight up the driveway,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.48,0:24:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过所有的恶魔和僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Past all the demons and the crotes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后一枪打死这恶魔吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we shoot the devil? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不喜欢「鲁莽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if you don't like, uh, "reckless, "
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.98,0:24:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许可以用「漫不经心」来形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use "insouciant, " maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他 他是5年前的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why is he? I mean, he's you five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.92,0:24:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他出什么事 你也玩了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something happens to him, you're gone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.86,0:24:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我让大家准备起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh… i'll get the grunts moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们装备好武器 午夜出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're loaded and on the road by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要带我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迦会保护你 不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zach's looking after you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.44,0:24:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.85,0:24:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.53,0:24:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来 我要给你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming because I want you to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.70,0:24:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你看看我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to see our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.93,0:25:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.01,0:25:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆在底特律没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam didn't die in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.31,0:25:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了 「同意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「同意」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.79,0:25:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.99,0:25:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.03,0:25:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对恶魔说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「同意」俩字\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.53,0:25:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法现在借由他的身体作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's wearing him to the prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.30,0:25:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now we don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在他身体里也不会出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in him, and it's not getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要去杀他 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've got to kill him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.29,0:25:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要见证这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to see it …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.29,0:25:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的一切 有多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole damn thing, how bad it gets …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.39,0:25:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就能走不同的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can do it different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迦说 他会把你送回09年的 是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zach said he was gonna bring you back, right? to '09?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.23,0:26:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.78,0:26:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那你回去后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you get back home…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.70,0:26:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要说「同意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚吗 对米迦勒说「同意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? say "yes" to michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我让他附身 米迦勒就能战胜恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let him in, then Michael fights the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.41,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会毁掉半个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battle's gonna torch half the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你周围 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.15,0:26:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个比没有好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the planet's better than no planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.62,0:26:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is what we have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能重来 我会立刻答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could do it over again, i'd say "yes" in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么不呢 我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you? i've tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.82,0:26:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喊到岔气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've shouted "yes" till I was blue in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.09,0:26:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们都不搭理\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels aren't listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.53,0:26:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是 离开了 放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just…left … gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说太迟了 但对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late for me, but for you …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.46,0:26:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一定还有其他方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. there's got to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.20,0:26:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太过自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想过我会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never actually thought i'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.44,0:26:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.45,0:26:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.55,0:27:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.35,0:27:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.61,0:27:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不在09年 不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's just not us, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.09,0:27:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是09年来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're really from '09?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.25,0:27:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.66,0:27:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你点忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some free advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.09,0:27:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到过去以后 记得囤积厕纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever get back there, you hoard toilet paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.83,0:27:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me? hoard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.23,0:27:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,像囤金子一样囤积起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoard it like it's made of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.70,0:27:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为现在它就是金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.87,0:27:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了啊 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.40,0:27:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感激我的 记住我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll thank me, all right. mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see those.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.89,0:28:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安非他明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amphetamines?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,极佳的醒酒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the perfect antidote to that absinthe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.37,0:28:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要会错我的意思 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.71,0:28:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.54,0:28:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴看到你不再愁眉苦脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy that the stick is out of your ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.75,0:28:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.25,0:28:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗑药 酗酒 还有爱情导师那套\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on … w-with the drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the orgies and the love-guru crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.62,0:28:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.49,0:28:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是个天使了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, i'm not an angel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.26,0:28:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.62,0:28:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我坠入凡间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I went mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? how?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜和其他天使的离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it had something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.83,0:28:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们逃跑的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they bailed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.65,0:28:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的魔力就就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mojo just kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.40,0:28:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,枯竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhrr! … drained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.30,0:28:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 我就是一个普通的凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, you know, i'm practically human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:28:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 迪恩 我毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, dean, i'm all but useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.37,0:29:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年 摔断了腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last year, broke my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧床了修养两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laid up for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.68,0:29:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 你是个凡人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.61,0:29:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入凡人俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我曾经属于一个更高级的俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except I used to belong to a much better club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.89,0:29:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我魔力全无\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now i'm powerless…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.06,0:29:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个毫无希望的可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hapless, i'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.23,0:29:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 为什么我他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why the hell not bury myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不沉溺在女人和颓废中呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In women and decadence, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.56,0:29:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.15,0:29:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,颓废就是为这准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what decadence is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不在死前好好享乐一番呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not bang a few gongs before the lights go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.07,0:29:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.44,0:29:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是我的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just how I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 第二层的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. second-floor window.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.64,0:30:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从那里进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.94,0:30:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.77,0:30:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝对看不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never see us coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在检查武器 五秒倒计时行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, weapons check. we're on the move in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.85,0:30:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.55,0:30:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.49,0:30:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.73,0:30:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.90,0:30:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对这些人对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying to these people and to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.03,0:30:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.17,0:30:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.34,0:30:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你撒谎时的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I know your lying expressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.50,0:30:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在镜子里看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen them in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.91,0:30:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么事瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's something you're not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.08,0:30:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.23,0:30:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我似乎不是你的队伍中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't seem to be the only member.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.67,0:30:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一个有疑心的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your posse wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.41,0:30:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 也许我去问问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, maybe i'll just take my doubts over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.69,0:30:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看看周围 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look around you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.62,0:30:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方应该塞满了僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place should be white-hot with crotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.26,0:30:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你有看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给我们让了一条道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cleared a path for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.76,0:31:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着这完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.97,0:31:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trap … exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.17,0:31:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不能从前面进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we can't go through the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.97,0:31:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 我们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the decoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.51,0:31:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们从后面进\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me … we're going in through the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指 你要把你的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you're gonna feed your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,送入虎口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into a meat grinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.92,0:31:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.72,0:31:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用他们的死来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to use their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.83,0:31:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散路西法的注意力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a diversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.02,0:31:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你脑子烧坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, something is broken in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是我永远不会做出的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making decisions that I would never make.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会平白牺牲我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't sacrifice my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.83,0:31:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 这正是我们如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the main reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷入困境的主要原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're in this mess, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人依靠你 信赖你\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people count on you. they trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们相信我会杀死恶魔拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They trust me to kill the devil and to save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那正是我要去做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's exactly what i'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会的 我不会让你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. not like this, you're not. i'm not gonna let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.91,0:31:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.58,0:31:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.62,0:32:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个惊喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.84,0:32:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千里迢迢赶来看这一幕 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come a long way to see this, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.48,0:32:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.58,0:32:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.39,0:33:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为那有点多此一举吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that would be a little…redundant?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.96,0:33:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很痛苦地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be painful…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.03,0:33:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,同穿着这身皮囊的我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking to me in this…shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是容器必须是你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it had to be your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.94,0:33:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.11,0:33:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你不必害怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be afraid of me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.31,0:33:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think i'm going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.62,0:33:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许毁了这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. maybe deep-fry the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要毁这美妙的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I want to destroy this stunning thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.46,0:33:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,炫彩斑斓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful in a trillion different ways…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.87,0:33:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的最后一个完美杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last perfect handiwork of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.24,0:33:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没听说过我是如何堕落的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hear the story of how I fell from grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.31,0:34:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不走运 你不是来告诉我该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good god. you're not gonna tell me a bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.78,0:34:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stomach's almost out of bile.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.88,0:34:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道上帝为什么丢下我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why god cast me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.79,0:34:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.79,0:34:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是上帝创造了…你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then god created…you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.14,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毛还没长齐的小人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little…Hairless apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我们大家要听从你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he asked all of us to bow down before you …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.15,0:34:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,比爱他更爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To love you more than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.92,0:34:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我说 「上帝…我做不到」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said, "father…I can't."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.32,0:34:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这些人类是有缺点的 凶残的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "these human beings are flawed, murderous."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.73,0:34:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.93,0:34:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝让米伽勒把我丢到了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}God had michael cast me into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.07,0:35:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你来告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.84,0:35:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这处罚对这罪行合适么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the punishment fit the crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.51,0:35:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其我还是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.51,0:35:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们这60亿人都为这事做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what 6 billion of you have done to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有多少人为这事责怪我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many of you blame me for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要愚弄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not fooling me. you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.86,0:35:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这种同情邪恶的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this sympathy-for-the-devil crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.13,0:35:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.90,0:35:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am i?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.74,0:35:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是同类 只是你更大些儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the same thing, only bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.84,0:35:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如出一辙的小强\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same brand of cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.81,0:35:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经毁了我的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been squashing my whole life …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑陋 邪恶 狡诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ugly, evil, belly-to-the-ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是他妈的扯蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernatural piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.42,0:35:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他们唯一的区别就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only difference between them and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.15,0:35:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the size of your ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.07,0:36:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.37,0:36:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有其他天使们看中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get what the other angels see in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.47,0:36:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.44,0:36:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不久会再次见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.25,0:36:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好现在就杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better kill me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.75,0:36:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.72,0:36:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好现在就杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.85,0:36:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我发誓 我将会找到方法杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I swear, I will find a way to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.99,0:36:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我不会停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.16,0:36:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.40,0:36:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也不会答应米伽勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't say "yes" to michael, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.23,0:36:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我知道你不会杀死萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you won't kill sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.14,0:36:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.30,0:36:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将永远在这儿结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will always end up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.71,0:36:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是被选中 还是你改变细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever choices you make, whatever details you alter,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都将永远在这儿结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always end up…here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.49,0:36:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.96,0:37:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.70,0:37:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.67,0:37:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年后来看你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in five years, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想对着耶稣说句去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, if it isn't the ghost of christmas "screw you."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.89,0:37:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.73,0:37:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.70,0:37:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了它 对么 你看见了发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it, right? you saw what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.73,0:37:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一能证明恶魔罪行的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only person who can prove the devil wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.50,0:37:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道这整个事情是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know that this whole thing isn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.97,0:37:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个天使的骗局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? some angel hocus-pocus?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.08,0:37:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time for tricks is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.08,0:37:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己交给米伽勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give yourself to michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:38:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说“答应” 我们就可以进攻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "yes, " and we can strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.05,0:38:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路西法得到萨姆之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before lucifer gets to sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.69,0:38:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在众人死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before billions die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.52,0:38:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在告诉我你还没吸取教训？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You telling me you haven't learned your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.32,0:38:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经吸取了教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i've learned a lesson, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.52,0:38:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不是你想教的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not the one you wanted to teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.79,0:38:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我只好不得不再教一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'll just have to teach it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.33,0:38:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我现在就得到你了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I got you now, boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And i'm never letting you …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.63,0:38:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.17,0:38:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty nice timing, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.94,0:38:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有约定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.11,0:39:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever change.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.15,0:39:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迦利亚是怎么找到你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did zachariah find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.19,0:39:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们从现在起就远离耶和华见证会 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stay away from jehovah's witnesses from now on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.16,0:39:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.00,0:39:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,首要我应该要做完的一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I should have done in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.14,0:39:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.35,0:40:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是认真的 你也想回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're serious and you want back in…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.52,0:40:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该紧紧把握这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you should hang on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.56,0:40:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信你已经没价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.07,0:40:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 兄弟 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.84,0:40:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. i'm…whatever I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.98,0:40:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.84,0:40:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.55,0:40:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.25,0:40:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.96,0:40:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.13,0:40:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是彼此的致命点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we are each other's achilles' heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.36,0:40:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会找到利用我们对抗对方的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll find a way to use us against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.00,0:41:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.47,0:41:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我们是彼此拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know we're all we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.31,0:41:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持彼此的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep each other human.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.35,0:41:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.32,0:41:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.69,0:41:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你堕落的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.29,0:41:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.69,0:41:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是你是这世上第二棒的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you are the second-best hunter on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.04,0:41:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们现在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.27,0:41:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们规划我们自己的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make our own future.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.14,0:41:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we have no choice.
